        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          What is the Khao Sok Elephant Sanctuary & Retirement Park? Domestic Asian elephants typically have 2 choices – carry tourists on their back or pull logs out of the forest. As they age, these jobs become difficult and dangerous to their health. This is true of the Khao Sok national park elephant. In order to offer a better life we have created the Khao Sok elephant sanctuary or retirement park. Here we provide a safe space for older elephants to enjoy life instead of working in exploitative situations. In addition to organic vegetables and fruit, our farm has plenty [...]
        </p>
